---

## 🚀 Featured Project — JanaMitra

> AI-powered multilingual welfare scheme discovery platform for Kerala government services

**What it does:**
- RAG pipeline (ChromaDB + Google Gemini) for accurate scheme Q&A — no hallucinations
- Care Services Marketplace with provider registration + slot-based booking
- Eligibility wizard across 10 beneficiary categories
- PDF application draft generator
- Malayalam ↔ English language toggle
- Admin panel with JWT auth + analytics dashboard

**Stack:** `FastAPI` `React` `MongoDB` `ChromaDB` `Google Gemini API` `ReportLab` `i18next`

🔗 [View Repository](https://github.com/VYSHNAVISVARIYAR/JanaMitra)

